# TEST STAND-IN for acpi.svc's power sources (PWR-004, tests/headless
# power-sources): QEMU has no ACPI battery. It registers the ACPI role as
# acpi.svc does (procmgr lets com.cubit.acpi register only from the startup
# plan) and answers Read_Metrics on the AC (21), battery (22) and identity
# (23) pages and the power-source watch (label 29) with acpi.svc's own
# codecs and watch policy over a scripted machine; every other request is
# refused. It holds no hardware. Never part of a production image.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.acpi"
  version => "0.0.1"
  requests => [
    (notification "acpi" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")
    # ABI-002: its debug text (CuBit.Console_Route).
    (service "logstore" "logstore")]
  optional => ["logstore"])
